{% extends "quarterly_deep_dive/llm_prompts/base_prompt.j2" %}

{# Specific context for the main narrative of Section 7 (DoS/InfoDisc) #}
{# NOTE: Correcting the likely error in REPORT_STRUCTURE which might have listed section3_narrative.j2 #}
{% set output_format_description = "a coherent narrative paragraph summarizing the analysis of DoS and Information Disclosure vulnerabilities, suitable for the main body text. Use Markdown for clarity (e.g., simple bolding) if helpful." %}

{% block task_instructions %}
Synthesize the provided chart insight, callout, and data summary for "{{ section_title }}" into a flowing narrative text focused specifically on Denial of Service (DoS) and Information Disclosure vulnerabilities.
Your narrative should cover the main trends observed during the reporting period regarding the volume and frequency of these two vulnerability types.
Integrate the key point highlighted in the callout. Aim for 3-5 sentences. You may use simple Markdown (like **bold**) for emphasis if appropriate.
{% endblock task_instructions %}

{% block data_context %}
Section Key: {{ data_context_payload.section_key | default('section_7_dos_infodisc_deep_dive') }}

Chart Insights Generated for this Section:
{% for chart_id, insight in data_context_payload.chart_insights_in_section.items() %}
- Insight ({{ chart_id }}): {{ insight }}
{% else %}
- No specific chart insights provided.
{% endfor %}

Callouts Generated for this Section:
{% for callout_key, callout_text in data_context_payload.callouts_in_section.items() %}
- {{ callout_key | replace("_", " ") | title }}: {{ callout_text }}
{% else %}
- No callouts generated for this section.
{% endfor %}

Data Summaries for Charts in this Section:
{% for chart_id, summary in data_context_payload.charts_data_summaries_in_section.items() %}
--- Data Summary: {{ chart_id }} ---
{{ summary }}
--- End Summary ---
{% else %}
- No chart data summaries provided.
{% endfor %}
{% endblock data_context %}
